  <item>
    <title>No.010-身弱和身强的财富密码，浅谈八字命理学和中医养生学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f86115676495707919203e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f86115676495707919203e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Mar 2024 15:43:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>☯️</span><strong><span>本期简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客邀请了八字易学爱好者仇仇，聊聊中国传统文化中的易经与中医之间神秘的内在关联。</span></p><span></span><p><span>五行阴阳，道藏精微，如何影响我们的健康与命运？</span></p><span></span><p><span>又如何依据八字看穿命数好坏，把握时机逆境反弹？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🚪联系主播加入听友群，了解你的财富密码：jlp_1214</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🔮</span><strong><span>Shownotes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">00:02:08</a>:</span><strong><span>中医和八字命理相似之处：（一）阴阳五行理论</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阴阳五行为生命之本，解读命运与健康的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">00:04:11</a>:八字如何看出身体问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在中医中，五行（金、木、水、火、土）与人体的脏腑系统相对应，用于解释和指导疾病的诊断和治疗。八字命理中，五行同样被用来分析个人的性格、命运和健康等。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5ED7y0CLVzzTOzm5sX0wC56KZw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">00:06:03</a>:八字基本理论，如何排盘，如何判断身强身弱，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以日干为基础，看其他7个字和日干之间的关系。帮扶多则为身强，克泄耗多则为身弱</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>身强身弱级别：极弱-中弱-次弱-平衡-次强-中强-极强</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>特殊情况：从强、从弱、真从、假从</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhY8hQtmJwgW7b3og5wAmFxxyfmN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">00:08:57</a>:身弱之人如何补</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>多补印（多读书）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>多靠近帮扶自己的贵人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>保护自己的喜用神和磁场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>注意休息，运动偏柔和比如八段锦，避免太过运作人际关系的工作</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">00:11:56</a>:「身弱」的财富追求与身心健康，中国传统文化的中庸之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">00:14:56</a>:</span><strong><span>中医和八字命理相似之处：（二）以人为本</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>中医强调根据个体的体质差异来进行治疗，这与八字命理中根据个人出生时的天干地支（即八字）来分析个体性格和命运的做法相似。</span></p><span></span><p><span>两者都认为每个人都是独特的，需要个性化的对待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">00:17:23</a>:身强之人，如何提升财运，身强补财星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">00:18:23</a>:如何从八字里看到每个人的天赋和性格特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">00:20:55</a>:八字中的食神与伤官，揭示人生天赋和性格特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">00:22:13</a>:「伤官」聪慧独立的艺术家，自由职业者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">00:24:09</a>:</span><strong><span>中医和八字命理相似之处：（三）生活中的留白艺术</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感知力、创造力在中医和八字命理中非常重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔮仇仇两个起卦的小故事分享：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>起卦看见了小狗，同事生了个儿子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>出门找身份证，起卦看到一个白色的托盘</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1792">00:29:52</a>:💰橘子今年财运的如何，偏财运的特质：机会之才，睡后收入</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span><strong><span>音乐：René Aubry - The Shell</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk1ew-x6pzRtQEYormKtkC4XH9sH.m4a" length="52181453" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpsrnrRlU4_P1OVga_Cm2mfbZNZe.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
