  <item>
    <title>No.005-拒绝内耗：在住酒店和住民宿之间，我选择了住寺庙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658553f9cab6086ec12d8717</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658553f9cab6086ec12d8717</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Dec 2023 09:16:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期邀请了冰冰聊了聊在寺庙做义工的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>橘子🍊在弘法寺写经院做了3天义工，是一个祛魅的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>冰冰🧊从最开始5天义工，第二次的10天，到现在的每周义工，每一次去东华禅寺是不断融入的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生何处不修行，修行在心不在于形式</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a>:寺庙的义工生活：远离都市的喧嚣，感知修行的静谧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">00:05:14</a>:东华禅寺的答疑解惑：如何帮助人们解决人生疑惑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">00:21:04</a>:修行的本质是感受自己的心，享受当下，达到身心合一的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">00:29:14</a>:寺庙中的觉察：从紧绷到平静，下山之后的改变</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Alan Ellis - The Longest Rest</span></p>]]></description>
